{"page":73,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:174","surah":3,"ayah":174,"ar_uthmani":"فَٱنقَلَبُوا۟ بِنِعْمَةٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَفَضْلٍ لَّمْ يَمْسَسْهُمْ سُوٓءٌ وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟ رِضْوَٰنَ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ ذُو فَضْلٍ عَظِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"returned with grace and bounty from God; no harm befell them. They pursued God’s good pleasure. God’s favour is great indeed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"So they returned","transliteration":"fa-inqalabū","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِنِعْمَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"with (the) Favor","transliteration":"biniʿ'matin","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَفَضْلٍۢ","en_gloss":"and Bounty","transliteration":"wafaḍlin","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَمْسَسْهُمْ","en_gloss":"touched them","transliteration":"yamsashum","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سُوٓءٌۭ","en_gloss":"any harm","transliteration":"sūon","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱتَّبَعُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they followed","transliteration":"wa-ittabaʿū","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رِضْوَٰنَ","en_gloss":"(the) pleasure","transliteration":"riḍ'wāna","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ذُو","en_gloss":"(is) Possessor","transliteration":"dhū","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَضْلٍ","en_gloss":"(of) Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlin","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَظِيمٍ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","verse_key":"3:174"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٧٤","en_gloss":"(174)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:174"}]},{"verse_key":"3:175","surah":3,"ayah":175,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا ذَٰلِكُمُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ يُخَوِّفُ أَوْلِيَآءَهُۥ فَلَا تَخَافُوهُمْ وَخَافُونِ إِن كُنتُم مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It is Satan who urges you to fear his followers; do not fear them, but fear Me, if you are true believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"(It is) only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālikumu","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُخَوِّفُ","en_gloss":"frightens (you)","transliteration":"yukhawwifu","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءَهُۥ","en_gloss":"(of) his allies","transliteration":"awliyāahu","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"So (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَخَافُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"fear them","transliteration":"takhāfūhum","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَخَافُونِ","en_gloss":"but fear Me","transliteration":"wakhāfūni","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُنتُم","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"believers","transliteration":"mu'minīna","verse_key":"3:175"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٧٥","en_gloss":"(175)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:175"}]},{"verse_key":"3:176","surah":3,"ayah":176,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَحْزُنكَ ٱلَّذِينَ يُسَـٰرِعُونَ فِى ٱلْكُفْرِ ۚ إِنَّهُمْ لَن يَضُرُّوا۟ ٱللَّهَ شَيْـًٔا ۗ يُرِيدُ ٱللَّهُ أَلَّا يَجْعَلَ لَهُمْ حَظًّا فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], do not be grieved by those who are quick to disbelieve. They will not harm God in the least; it is God’s will that they will have no share in the Hereafter- a terrible torment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْزُنكَ","en_gloss":"grieve you","transliteration":"yaḥzunka","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُسَـٰرِعُونَ","en_gloss":"hasten","transliteration":"yusāriʿūna","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in(to)","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْكُفْرِ ۚ","en_gloss":"[the] disbelief","transliteration":"l-kuf'ri","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَضُرُّوا۟","en_gloss":"will harm","transliteration":"yaḍurrū","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":11,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا ۗ","en_gloss":"(in) anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"intends","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَجْعَلَ","en_gloss":"He will set","transliteration":"yajʿala","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":17,"ar":"حَظًّۭا","en_gloss":"any portion","transliteration":"ḥaẓẓan","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"And for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":21,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":22,"ar":"عَظِيمٌ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"3:176"},{"pos":23,"ar":"١٧٦","en_gloss":"(176)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:176"}]},{"verse_key":"3:177","surah":3,"ayah":177,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱشْتَرَوُا۟ ٱلْكُفْرَ بِٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ لَن يَضُرُّوا۟ ٱللَّهَ شَيْـًٔا وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who sell their faith for disbelief will not harm God in any way; agonizing torment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱشْتَرَوُا۟","en_gloss":"(have) purchased","transliteration":"ish'tarawū","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكُفْرَ","en_gloss":"[the] disbelief","transliteration":"l-kuf'ra","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"with the faith","transliteration":"bil-īmāni","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَضُرُّوا۟","en_gloss":"will they harm","transliteration":"yaḍurrū","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"(in) anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmun","verse_key":"3:177"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٧٧","en_gloss":"(177)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:177"}]},{"verse_key":"3:178","surah":3,"ayah":178,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَحْسَبَنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ أَنَّمَا نُمْلِى لَهُمْ خَيْرٌ لِّأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ إِنَّمَا نُمْلِى لَهُمْ لِيَزْدَادُوٓا۟ إِثْمًا ۚ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مُّهِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The disbelievers should not think that it is better for them that We give them more time: when We give them more time they become more sinful- a shameful torment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْسَبَنَّ","en_gloss":"think","transliteration":"yaḥsabanna","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنَّمَا","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"annamā","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نُمْلِى","en_gloss":"We give respite","transliteration":"num'lī","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) good","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِّأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"for themselves","transliteration":"li-anfusihim","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نُمْلِى","en_gloss":"We give respite","transliteration":"num'lī","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِيَزْدَادُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"so that they may increase","transliteration":"liyazdādū","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِثْمًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) sins","transliteration":"ith'man","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مُّهِينٌۭ","en_gloss":"humiliating","transliteration":"muhīnun","verse_key":"3:178"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١٧٨","en_gloss":"(178)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:178"}]},{"verse_key":"3:179","surah":3,"ayah":179,"ar_uthmani":"مَّا كَانَ ٱللَّهُ لِيَذَرَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَىٰ مَآ أَنتُمْ عَلَيْهِ حَتَّىٰ يَمِيزَ ٱلْخَبِيثَ مِنَ ٱلطَّيِّبِ ۗ وَمَا كَانَ ٱللَّهُ لِيُطْلِعَكُمْ عَلَى ٱلْغَيْبِ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَجْتَبِى مِن رُّسُلِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ ۖ فَـَٔامِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۚ وَإِن تُؤْمِنُوا۟ وَتَتَّقُوا۟ فَلَكُمْ أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Nor was it God’s aim to leave you as you were, with no separation between the bad and the good. God would not show you [people] what is hidden; God chooses as His messengers whoever He will. So believe in God and His messengers: if you believe and stay mindful of God, you will have a great reward.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِيَذَرَ","en_gloss":"to leave","transliteration":"liyadhara","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you (are)","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"in [it]","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَمِيزَ","en_gloss":"He separates","transliteration":"yamīza","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْخَبِيثَ","en_gloss":"the evil","transliteration":"l-khabītha","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the good","transliteration":"l-ṭayibi","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَمَا","