":"ajrun","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":36,"ar":"عَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"3:179"},{"pos":37,"ar":"١٧٩","en_gloss":"(179)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:179"}]},{"verse_key":"3:180","surah":3,"ayah":180,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَحْسَبَنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَبْخَلُونَ بِمَآ ءَاتَىٰهُمُ ٱللَّهُ مِن فَضْلِهِۦ هُوَ خَيْرًا لَّهُم ۖ بَلْ هُوَ شَرٌّ لَّهُمْ ۖ سَيُطَوَّقُونَ مَا بَخِلُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ وَلِلَّهِ مِيرَٰثُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who are miserly with what God has granted them out of His grace should not think that it is good for them; on the contrary, it is bad for them. Whatever they meanly withhold will be hung around their necks on the Day of Resurrection. It is God who will inherit the heavens and earth: God is well aware of everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْسَبَنَّ","en_gloss":"think","transliteration":"yaḥsabanna","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَبْخَلُونَ","en_gloss":"withhold","transliteration":"yabkhalūna","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَاتَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"(has) given them","transliteration":"ātāhumu","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"(that) it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","en_gloss":"(is) good","transliteration":"khayran","verse_key":"3:180"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَّهُم ۖ","en_gloss":"for